      "text": "La Paz – Copacabana – Isla del Sol – Copacabana"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:4b5ff9b4a37f43cc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "ccb37263c5841b07d5b8582ac6536390f8cc916aad1de36baf46935ac308e6fb",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-wm-p7lxhnqwgwc",
        "model": "GPT-6.1"
      },
      "text": "After breakfast, transfer from La Paz to Copacabana.\n\nCopacabana sits at around 3,810 m above sea level. The journey takes about 3.5 hours.\n\nAlong the way, you'll cross the Strait of Tiquina by motorboat. The crossing takes around 20 minutes. The strait separates the two parts of Lake Titicaca, the smaller Wiñaymarka and the larger Chucuito.\n\nOn arrival in Copacabana, have lunch at the hotel restaurant.\n\nThen transfer to the port and take a boat to Isla del Sol. The crossing takes around 45 minutes.\n\nOn the island, you'll visit the Inca Garden, the sacred Inca fountain, Pilcokaina Palace and the Yumani steps.\n\nReturn to Copacabana by speedboat and transfer back to your hotel."
    },
